# Throwaway diagnostic probes (cfgver-scaling-diagnostics convention).
# These are measurement scaffolding: never in _CoqProject, and they contain
# `Admitted.` because they measure a VC's cost rather than proving it. They
# must stay UNTRACKED -- scripts/gate.sh's hole scan reads the filesystem, so
# committing them blocks the merge gate outright. That happened twice
# (2026-08-13's ZZKsl* set, and once before), hence this rule.
case_study/RiscvPmp/CFGVer/Example/ZZ*
